### Looking at traces locally

`docker compose up` also starts Grafana's
[otel-lgtm](https://github.com/grafana/docker-otel-lgtm) image, and the API
and worker send their spans to it. Open http://localhost:3000 (admin / admin),
then Explore → Tempo. Outside Docker, set
`OTEL_EXPORTER_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318` in `.env` and keep just that
service running: `docker compose up -d otel-lgtm`.

Its Prometheus reads `docker/prometheus.yaml`, which is the image's own file
plus the scrape jobs this project adds; change it there.
